                        >
                            <Sword size={18} /> Attack Phase
                        </button>
```

If the button appears "darker than normal" while highlighted, it implies the mask might be covering it, or there are multiple overlays.

In `TutorialOverlay.tsx`, the mask is implemented as:
```typescript
